              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": []
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e73723c34105eb56"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A Golden Theater Musical Department yearly special"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7923b93f2ac0a7f6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Toward the end of the second Guardian Alexandra's life, her heart was incessantly filled with guilt."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "A beautiful maiden stepped up to the political arena, giving up her personal life, carrying out her duties with utmost determination."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Architects guide her on the path of Preservation, and the count and she grew close, though never formalizing their relationship. The commander of the Silvermane Guards fought alongside her."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "When she looks back on her life, will she lament on her many missed chances at love?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"Alexandra, do you regret it all?\""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9bab1e653f28d2c7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Three Goliards Awards for Best Actor in a Musical:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The youngest Goliards Award winner for Best Orchestration:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Six-time Goliards Lifetime Achievement Award Winner:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-026e88f8f404c4b4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Potential new casting:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ddaee77b40eb2e28"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Director: Meeya, Producer: Carl, Music Director: Catherine"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
